##### \`Namespace\`<sup>Required</sup> <a name="Namespace" id="aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.Selector.property.namespace"></a>

\`\`\`csharp
public string Namespace { get; set; }
\`\`\`

- *Type:* string

The Kubernetes namespace that the selector should match.

You must specify a namespace for a selector. The selector only matches pods
that are created in this namespace, but you can create multiple selectors
to target multiple namespaces.

---

##### \`Labels\`<sup>Optional</sup> <a name="Labels" id="aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.Selector.property.labels"></a>

\`\`\`csharp
