### Cluster <a name="Cluster" id="monocdk.aws_eks.Cluster"></a>

- *Implements:* Constructs.IConstruct, Amazon.CDK.IConstruct, Amazon.CDK.IDependable, Amazon.CDK.IResource, <a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.ICluster">ICluster</a>, Amazon.CDK.aws_ec2.IConnectable

A Cluster represents a managed Kubernetes Service (EKS).

This is a fully managed cluster of API Servers (control-plane)
The user is still required to create the worker nodes.

#### Initializers <a name="Initializers" id="monocdk.aws_eks.Cluster.Initializer"></a>

