### FargateCluster <a name="FargateCluster" id="aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.FargateCluster"></a>

- *Implements:* github.com/aws/constructs-go/constructs/v10.IConstruct, github.com/aws/constructs-go/constructs/v10.IDependable, github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk/v2.IResource, <a href="#aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.ICluster">ICluster</a>, github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk/v2.aws_ec2.IConnectable

Defines an EKS cluster that runs entirely on AWS Fargate.

The cluster is created with a default Fargate Profile that matches the
"default" and "kube-system" namespaces. You can add additional profiles using
\`addFargateProfile\`.

#### Initializers <a name="Initializers" id="aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.FargateCluster.Initializer"></a>

