##### \`AssociatePublicIpAddress\`<sup>Optional</sup> <a name="AssociatePublicIpAddress" id="aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.AutoScalingGroupCapacityOptions.property.associatePublicIpAddress"></a>

\`\`\`go
AssociatePublicIpAddress *bool
\`\`\`

- *Type:* *bool
