| <code><a href="#aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.ClusterOptions.property.secretsEncryptionKey">SecretsEncryptionKey</a></code> | <code>github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk/v2.aws_kms.IKey</code> | KMS secret for envelope encryption for Kubernetes secrets. |

