### Cluster <a name="Cluster" id="monocdk.aws_eks.Cluster"></a>

- *Implements:* github.com/aws/constructs-go/constructs/v3.IConstruct, github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.IConstruct, github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.IDependable, github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.IResource, <a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.ICluster">ICluster</a>, github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.aws_ec2.IConnectable

A Cluster represents a managed Kubernetes Service (EKS).

This is a fully managed cluster of API Servers (control-plane)
The user is still required to create the worker nodes.

