##### \`MaxCapacity\`<sup>Optional</sup> <a name="MaxCapacity" id="monocdk.aws_eks.AutoScalingGroupCapacityOptions.property.maxCapacity"></a>

\`\`\`go
MaxCapacity *f64
\`\`\`

