| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.ClusterOptions.property.coreDnsComputeType">CoreDnsComputeType</a></code> | <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.CoreDnsComputeType">CoreDnsComputeType</a></code> | Controls the "eks.amazonaws.com/compute-type" annotation in the CoreDNS configuration on your cluster to determine which compute type to use for CoreDNS. |
