| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.vpcSubnets">VpcSubnets</a></code> | <code>*[]github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.aws_ec2.SubnetSelection</code> | Where to place EKS Control Plane ENIs. |
| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.clusterHandlerEnvironment">ClusterHandlerEnvironment</a></code> | <code>*map[string]*string</code> | Custom environment variables when interacting with the EKS endpoint to manage the cluster lifecycle. |
| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.coreDnsComputeType">CoreDnsComputeType</a></code> | <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.CoreDnsComputeType">CoreDnsComputeType</a></code> | Controls the "eks.amazonaws.com/compute-type" annotation in the CoreDNS configuration on your cluster to determine which compute type to use for CoreDNS. |
| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.endpointAccess">EndpointAccess</a></code> | <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.EndpointAccess">EndpointAccess</a></code> | Configure access to the Kubernetes API server endpoint.. |
| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.kubectlEnvironment">KubectlEnvironment</a></code> | <code>*map[string]*string</code> | Environment variables for the kubectl execution. |
| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.kubectlLayer">KubectlLayer</a></code> | <code>github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.aws_lambda.ILayerVersion</code> | An AWS Lambda Layer which includes \`kubectl\`, Helm and the AWS CLI. |
