| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.mastersRole">MastersRole</a></code> | <code>github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.aws_iam.IRole</code> | An IAM role that will be added to the \`system:masters\` Kubernetes RBAC group. |
