| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.secretsEncryptionKey">SecretsEncryptionKey</a></code> | <code>github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.aws_kms.IKey</code> | KMS secret for envelope encryption for Kubernetes secrets. |
| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateClusterProps.property.defaultProfile">DefaultProfile</a></code> | <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateProfileOptions">FargateProfileOptions</a></code> | Fargate Profile to create along with the cluster. |

