| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateProfileProps.property.subnetSelection">SubnetSelection</a></code> | <code>github.com/aws/aws-cdk-go/awscdk.aws_ec2.SubnetSelection</code> | Select which subnets to launch your pods into. |
