##### \`DiskSize\`<sup>Optional</sup> <a name="DiskSize" id="monocdk.aws_eks.NodegroupProps.property.diskSize"></a>

\`\`\`go
DiskSize *f64
\`\`\`

- *Type:* *f64
- *Default:* 20

