| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.FargateCluster.Initializer.parameter.endpointAccess">endpointAccess</a></code> | <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.EndpointAccess">EndpointAccess</a></code> | Configure access to the Kubernetes API server endpoint.. |
