| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.EksOptimizedImage.Initializer.parameter.kubernetesVersion">kubernetesVersion</a></code> | <code>java.lang.String</code> | The Kubernetes version to use. |
| <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.EksOptimizedImage.Initializer.parameter.nodeType">nodeType</a></code> | <code><a href="#monocdk.aws_eks.NodeType">NodeType</a></code> | What instance type to retrieve the image for (standard or GPU-optimized). |

