##### \`is_cfn_element\` <a name="is_cfn_element" id="aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.CfnFargateProfile.isCfnElement"></a>

\`\`\`python
from aws_cdk import aws_eks

aws_eks.CfnFargateProfile.is_cfn_element(
  x: typing.Any
)
\`\`\`

Returns \`true\` if a construct is a stack element (i.e. part of the synthesized cloudformation template).

Uses duck-typing instead of \`instanceof\` to allow stack elements from different
versions of this library to be included in the same stack.

###### \`x\`<sup>Required</sup> <a name="x" id="aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.CfnFargateProfile.isCfnElement.parameter.x"></a>

- *Type:* typing.Any

