| <code><a href="#aws-cdk-lib.aws_eks.AutoScalingGroupCapacityOptions.property.healthCheck">healthCheck</a></code> | <code>aws-cdk-lib.aws_autoscaling.HealthCheck</code> | Configuration for health checks. |
